">A spreadsheet of real leads.<br/><span class="text-[#a1a1aa]">With real data from real sources.</span></h2><p class="text-sm sm:text-[15px] text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed max-w-[600px]">Not a magic black box. Origami searches specific data sources you can see, returns structured results in a table you can edit, and lets you add enrichment columns for emails, phone numbers, tech stack, and more.</p></div><div class="grid grid-cols-1 md:grid-cols-2 gap-5"><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Chat interface → spreadsheet output</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">You type what you&#x27;re looking for in plain English. The AI interprets your request, picks the right data sources, and populates a spreadsheet. You can see every source it searched and refine with follow-up messages.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">15+ built-in data sources</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Social profiles and companies, Google Maps listings, job boards (100+ aggregated), Shopify and WooCommerce stores, tech stack databases, funding data, news, Twitter/X, and more. No API keys or external accounts needed.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Add enrichment columns</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Once your leads are in the spreadsheet, ask Origami to add columns, verified work emails, direct phone numbers, employee count, tech stack, funding history, or any custom data point. Each column enriches every row automatically.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Relevance scoring</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Define what makes a lead qualified and Origami scores every row as pass, fail, or unsure. Filter to show only qualified leads, then export. No manual sorting through hundreds of irrelevant results.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">CSV import</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Already have a list? Upload a CSV and Origami matches your records against live data, fills in missing fields, and adds whatever enrichment columns you need. Same AI, applied to your existing data.</p></div><div class="group border border-[#e4e4e7] bg-white p-6 sm:p-8 flex flex-col transition-all duration-200 hover:-translate-y-1 hover:shadow-[0_8px_30px_rgba(0,0,0,0.08)] hover:border-[#d4d4d8]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(20px)"><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b] mb-2 group-hover:text-[#09090b] transition-colors">Enroll, export, or hand off</h3><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed">Drop your filtered list into the built-in Sequencer for social and email outreach, push to HubSpot or Salesforce, or download a clean CSV. The list goes from search results to active outreach in the same surface.</p></div></div></div></section><section class="w-full bg-white pt-16 pb-20 md:pt-20 md:pb-28"><div class="max-w-[1100px] mx-auto px-4 sm:px-6"><p class="text-[11px] sm:text-xs font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#09090b]/40 mb-8 md:mb-10" style="opacity:0">[03] What People Actually Search For</p><div class="max-w-[800px] mb-10 md:mb-14" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(24px)"><h2 class="text-2xl sm:text-3xl md:text-[38px] font-medium text-[#09090b] leading-[1.15] tracking-tight">Real prompts from real users.</h2></div><div class="space-y-0 border border-[#e4e4e7] divide-y divide-[#e4e4e7]"><div class="group p-6 sm:p-8 bg-white transition-all duration-200 hover:bg-[#FAFAFA] hover:shadow-[inset_4px_0_0_0_#FE7BCD]" style="opacity:0;transform:translateY(12px)"><div class="flex flex-col md:flex-row md:items-start gap-4 md:gap-12"><div class="md:w-1/3 flex-shrink-0"><span class="text-[10px] font-medium tracking-[0.2em] uppercase text-[#a1a1aa] mb-1 block">01</span><h3 class="text-[15px] sm:text-base font-medium text-[#09090b]">Local service businesses</h3></div><div class="md:flex-1"><p class="text-sm text-[#71717a] leading-relaxed mb-3">Google Maps is one of Origami&#x27;s strongest sources. Find any local business by type, location, rating, and review count, then enrich with owner contact info that traditional B2B databases don&#x27;t have.</p><div class="inline-flex items-center gap-2 px-3 py-1.5 bg-[#FAFAFA] border border-[#e4e4e7] text-[12px] text-[#52525b]"><span class="text-[#a1a1aa]">Example:</span><span class="italic">“<!-- -->Roofing companies in Dallas with 10+ employees and a 4.5+ Google rating<!-- 